In Rules:</strong> For handling incoming transactions.</span></span></p></li><li data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"996\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"998\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"998\">Money Out Rules:</strong> For managing outgoing transactions.</span></span></p></li></ul><p style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"998\" style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img class=\"WACImage SCXW3608698 BCX0 fr-fic fr-dii\" alt=\"Picture, Picture\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234452518/original/xu8wWRCj7G64M1DTi-dh_F4qHZG5fSxHgA.png?1753094526\" data-id=\"9234452518\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: none; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px; display: inline-block; margin-left: 5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; width: 718px; height: 323.517px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1052\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br><strong>Creating a New Bank Rule</strong></span>